@SeatingService.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5150
@token = Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

### Obtener todas las mesas
GET {{SeatingService.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/tables
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

###

### Obtener mesas por estado (Available | Reserved | Occupied | OutOfService)
GET {{SeatingService.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/tables?status=Available
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

###

### Obtener mesa por Id
GET {{SeatingService.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/tables/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

###

### Crear una mesa (solo Admin)
POST {{SeatingService.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/tables
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "number": "1",
  "capacity": 4,
  "location": "Salón principal"
}

###

### Actualizar mesa (solo Admin)
PUT {{SeatingService.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/tables/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "number": "1",
  "capacity": 6,
  "location": "Terraza"
}

###

### Eliminar mesa (solo Admin)
DELETE {{SeatingService.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/tables/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: {{token}}

###

### Asignar pedido a una mesa (Admin, Waiter)
POST {{SeatingService.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/tables/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/assign-order
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "orderId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

###

### Liberar mesa (Admin, Waiter, Cashier)
POST {{SeatingService.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/tables/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/release
Authorization: {{token}}

###

### Cambiar estado de mesa manualmente (solo Admin)
PATCH {{SeatingService.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/tables/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "status": 2
}

###
